Killing a '''Barbarian''' will make the player gain {{Reputation|Mage|5}} and lose {{Reputation|Barbarian|5}}, up to a limit of {{Reputation|Mage|0}} and {{Reputation|Barbarian|0}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Barbarians''' wield an Iron Sword (with the metadata of the [[Raider Sword]], as shown through texture packs) which they use to attack the player, only if they were provoked first or the player has less than {{Reputation|Barbarian|-1000}}. They deal {{Stat|dmg|3,500}} on hit.

